#: OldView.cpp:198
msgid ""
"<p>These are the <img src=\"small|exec\"/> <strong>services</strong> "
"available on your computer. To start a service, drag it onto the <em>Start</em> "
"section of a runlevel.</p>"
"<p>To stop one, do the same for the <em>Stop</em> section.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>यि <img src=\"small|exec\"/> <strong>सेवा</strong> "
"तपाईँको कम्प्युटरमा उपलब्ध छन् । कार्य सरु गर्न, यसलाई रनलेभलको <em>सुरु</em> "
"खण्डमा तान्नुहोस् ।</p>"
"<p>बन्द गर्न, यहि कार्य <em>बन्द</em> खण्डमा गर्नुहोस् ।</p>"

#: OldView.cpp:242
msgid ""
"<p>You can drag services from a runlevel onto the <img src=\"small|trash\"/> "
"<strong>trashcan</strong> to delete them from that runlevel.</p>"
"<p>The <strong>Undo command</strong> can be used to restore deleted entries.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>तपाईँले रनलेभलमा कार्य मेट्न तिनलाई रनलेभलबाट <img src=\"small|trash\"/> "
"<strong>रद्दीटोकरी</strong> तान्न सक्नुहुन्छ ।</p>"
"<p> मेटिएका प्रविष्टि पुन: भण्डारण गर्न <strong>पूर्वावस्थामा फर्काउने "
"आदेश</strong> प्रयोग गर्न सकिनेछ ।</p>"

#: OldView.cpp:254
#, c-format
msgid "Runlevel &%1"
msgstr "रनलेभल %1"

#: OldView.cpp:256
#, c-format
msgid "Runlevel %1"
msgstr "रनलेभल %1"

#: OldView.cpp:260
msgid ""
"<p>These are the services <strong>started</strong> in runlevel %1.</p>"
"<p>The number shown on the left of the <img src=\"user|ksysv_start\"/> "
"icon determines the order in which the services are started. You can arrange "
"them via drag and drop, as long as a suitable <em>sorting number</em> "
"can be generated.</p>"
"<p>If that's not possible, you have to change the number manually via the "
"<strong>Properties dialog box</strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>यि रनलेभल %1 मा <strong>सुरु गरिएका</strong> सेवा हुन् ।</p>"
"<p> <img src=\"user|ksysv_start\"/> प्रतिमाको बायाँतिर देखाएका नम्बरले कार्यको "
"सुरुआतको क्रम निर्धारण गर्छ । तपाईँले तिनलाई तान्ने र राख्ने गरेर मिलाउन "
"सक्नुहुन्छ, उपयुक्त हुने जति लामो <em>क्रमबद्ध सङ्ख्या</em> "
"मा उत्पन्न गर्न सकिनेछ ।</p>"
"<p>यदि त्यो सम्भव नभएमा, तपाईँले <strong>विशेषता सम्वाद बाकस</strong> "
"हातैले प्रयोग गरेर परिवर्तन गर्नुपर्छ ।</p>"

#: OldView.cpp:268
msgid "Start"
msgstr "सुरु"

#: OldView.cpp:278
msgid ""
"<p>These are the services <strong>stopped</strong> in runlevel %1.</p>"
"<p>The number shown on the left of the <img src=\"user|ksysv_stop\"/> "
"icon determines the order in which the services are stopped. You can arrange "
"them via drag and drop, as long as a suitable <em>sorting number</em> "
"can be generated.</p>"
"<p>If that's not possible, you have to change the number manually via the "
"<strong>Properties dialog box</strong>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>यि रनलेभल %1 <strong>रोकिएका</strong> कार्य हुन् ।</p>"
"<p> <img src=\"user|ksysv_stop\"/> प्रतिमाको बायाँतिर देखिएका नम्बरले कार्य "
"रोकिने क्रमको निर्धारण गर्छ । तपाईँले तिनलाई तान्ने र राख्ने गरेर मिलाउन "
"सक्नुहुन्छ, उपयुक्त हुनेसम्म लामो हुने गरि <em>क्रमबद्धता सङ्ख्या</em> "
"उत्पन्न गर्न सकिनेछ ।</p>"
"<p>यदि त्यो सम्भव नभएमा, तपाईँले <strong>विशेषता सम्वाद बाकस</strong> "
"म्यानुअल तरिकाले परिवर्तन गर्नुपर्छ ।</p>"

